# Agent rules (eod-field-app)

**Never push to `main` without an explicit go from Tyson in the current message.** Feature work goes on branches. Asking for a change is NOT permission to push `main`; a past go does not carry forward.

`main` is the published field app; publishing is a separate explicit step (`eod-field-app-publish`).

Pilot `/eod-field-app/` and fleet `/EOD/` share one eod-api backend. Never ship pilot work to `/EOD/`.

No email, SMS, magic link, or invite goes to a real person unless Tyson asks for that send in the current turn.
